# 7. Architectural Classification (important for your research)

### Is it structural skin?

❌ No

### It is:

✔ **Structural field system**
✔ **Space-frame via arches (but non-repetitive)**
✔ **Load-bearing spatial envelope (but not façade-driven)**

👉 More precise term:

> **“Structuralized spatial field”**

